        "comments": "The assembly daLatClan1.hap1.1 is based on 90x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and orientation of the scaffolds on are uncertain on: Chromosome 2 (27,835 ? 47,082 Kbp), Chromosome 4 (11,004 ? 19,288 Kbp), Chromosome 6 (16,513 ? 21,331 Kbp) & Chromosome 15 (22,961 ? 23,963 Kbp).",
